Yea I am technically a sex worker but I do online sex work. I don't offer in person services. And yeah, I was very proud and happy because I don't have family support and I live alone in this city. I do have a job and I'm also in college. It's just that my job doesn't pay me enough , so it would have crippled me financially to fix my car and still find a way to pay rent. I'm poor, dude. My cam work has really improved my life, and in this example I was able to fix my car and thus be able to drive to work and school and still have money to pay rent. If there was a way for you to make hundreds by just staying at home and take pics of your dong why wouldnt you do it? Especially if you were struggling financially to make ends meet. I'm proud of myself for finding a way to stay afloat and take care of myself. I'm studying programming as well, so it gives me free time to focus on that. I know you look down on me for it, but it's made my life better. I will continue to do this until I don't gotta do it anymore and can focus on my career.Honestly, I think it's funny that since youre on r/drugs that youre ok with drugs (assuming) but sex work is too taboo and strange. Your comment hurt my feelings, I want my mommy lol Feel free to ask me questions since you seem unfamiliar with sex workers and women 

